| **AT3: Wait for Retrieval** | Robot waits until the storage retrieves the requested resources. | AND | StorageLocation | 1 | The robot must pause until the items are ready. |
| **AT4: Navigate to Destination** | Robot moves to the destination location where resources must be delivered. | AND | Destination | 1 | The robot must travel to the delivery point. |
| **AT5: Deliver Resources to Destination** | Robot delivers the collected resources to the destination location. | AND | Destination | 1 | The robot must physically hand over the items. |
| **AT6: Recharge at Recharging Station** | Robot goes to the recharging station to recharge its battery. | AND | RechargingStation | 1 | Recharging is performed by the same robot that is low on power. |
| **AT7: Return Resource to Checkpoint** | Robot returns the resource to a checkpoint location. | AND | Checkpoint | 1 | The robot must bring the resource to a safe spot before handing over. |
| **AT8: Send Alert to Sector Manager** | Robot sends an alert and report to the sector manager. | AND | SectorManager | 1 | The robot must notify the manager if it cannot return to the checkpoint. |
| **AT9: Assign Mission to Another Robot** | Robot assigns the remaining task to another robot. | AND | CentralCommand | 1 | The robot must re‑assign the task to keep the mission moving. |

